{
    "title": "Snake.io NETFLIX",
    "description": "NETFLIX MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED.\r\n\r\nIt's a snake-eat-snake world: Slither around the screen to collect energy, grow bigger and devour your competition in this fast-paced arcade game.\r\n\r\nYou'll start out as a small snake in each round. Eat energy pellets to expand your size, and surround or cut in front of other snakes to explode them into (edible) segments. But watch out \u2014 because they'll be trying to do the same to you. In this reptilian battle royale, how long can you stay in one piece?\r\n\r\nNetflix members can put their reflexes to the test with this mobile version of the classic .io arcade game played by hundreds of millions. Fine-tuned touch controls give you the precision you need to outmaneuver every other sneaky serpent on the field of battle.\r\n\r\nSLITHER, EAT, SURVIVE\r\n\r\n\u2022 Dart in front of other snakes and watch them explode when they hit you head on \u2014 then eat them as fast as you can to bulk up.\r\n\u2022 Use the boost button to increase your speed at crucial moments. But deploy it wisely, since you'll lose mass each time you boost.\r\n\r\nGET BIG, SCORE BIGGER\r\n\r\n\u2022 Your score increases with your size; stay alive to thrive and try to set a new personal record with each round.\r\n\u2022 Leaderboards let you see how your survival skills stack up with friends and other players.\r\n\r\nNEW WAYS TO PLAY\r\n\r\n\u2022 Complete achievements and daily challenges to add fun and colorful snake skins to your collection.\r\n\u2022 Themed live events give you opportunities to take on big, bad boss snakes and unlock exclusive skins.\r\n\u2022 Play offline or online; no internet connection required.\r\n\r\n- Created by Kooapps.\r\n\r\nPlease note that the Data Safety information applies to information collected and used in this app. See the Netflix Privacy Statement to learn more about information we collect and use in this and other contexts, including at account registration.",
    "descriptionHTML": "NETFLIX MEMBERSHIP REQUIRED.<br><br>It&#39;s a snake-eat-snake world: Slither around the screen to collect energy, grow bigger and devour your competition in this fast-paced arcade game.<br><br>You&#39;ll start out as a small snake in each round. Eat energy pellets to expand your size, and surround or cut in front of other snakes to explode them into (edible) segments. But watch out \u2014 because they&#39;ll be trying to do the same to you. In this reptilian battle royale, how long can you stay in one piece?<br><br>Netflix members can put their reflexes to the test with this mobile version of the classic .io arcade game played by hundreds of millions. Fine-tuned touch controls give you the precision you need to outmaneuver every other sneaky serpent on the field of battle.<br><br>SLITHER, EAT, SURVIVE<br><br>\u2022 Dart in front of other snakes and watch them explode when they hit you head on \u2014 then eat them as fast as you can to bulk up.<br>\u2022 Use the boost button to increase your speed at crucial moments. But deploy it wisely, since you&#39;ll lose mass each time you boost.<br><br>GET BIG, SCORE BIGGER<br><br>\u2022 Your score increases with your size; stay alive to thrive and try to set a new personal record with each round.<br>\u2022 Leaderboards let you see how your survival skills stack up with friends and other players.<br><br>NEW WAYS TO PLAY<br><br>\u2022 Complete achievements and daily challenges to add fun and colorful snake skins to your collection.<br>\u2022 Themed live events give you opportunities to take on big, bad boss snakes and unlock exclusive skins.<br>\u2022 Play offline or online; no internet connection required.<br><br>- Created by Kooapps.<br><br>Please note that the Data Safety information applies to information collected and used in this app. See the Netflix Privacy Statement to learn more about information we collect and use in this and other contexts, including at account registration.",
